ign, Launch, and Learn phases" class="max-w-full h-auto max-h-[180px] rounded-lg shadow-lg" src="/images/activation_loop.svg?v=2"></div><div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-white/70 lg:justify-start" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(1.46212px);"><span>Powered by</span><img alt="Solana" class="h-6 w-6" src="/images/solana.svg"><span>Solana</span></div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center lg:justify-end space-y-6" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><div class="w-full max-w-md rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/5 p-6 backdrop-blur-md"><h2 class="text-xl font-space font-bold mb-2">Wallet &amp; NFTs — loaded only inside Journeys</h2><p class="text-sm opacity-80 leading-relaxed">To keep the landing page ultra-light (performance + CSP), the Solana/wallet-adapter stack is loaded only when you enter <span class="font-semibold">Journeys</span>.</p><div class="mt-4"><button class="btn-primary w-full" tabindex="0">Open Journeys</button><button class="btn-secondary w-full mt-3" tabindex="0">Try Demo</button></div></div></div></div></div><button class="absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors" style="opacity: 1;"><div style="transform: translateY(1.76191px);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></div></button></section><section id="personas" class="relative py-20"><div class="mx-auto w-full px-0 space-y-16 sm:px-2 lg:px-4 xl:px-6"><div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-space font-bold mb-6">Chart Your Mission Trajectory</h2><p class="text-lg md:text-xl opacity-80 leading-relaxed mb-4">Choose the journey that matches your ambition. Each pathway is a curated stack of phases that transform prototype energy into verifiable Proof-of-Skill™ capital.</p><button class="btn-primary inline-flex items-center space-x-2" tabindex="0"><span>Open the Journey Dashboard</span></button></div><div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><div class="glass-effect rounded-2xl p-6 text-left"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-accent-cyan mb-3">Orchestrated Learning</h3><p class="text-base text-white/80 mb-4 leading-relaxed">Zyno and the protocol agent mesh coordinate missions, resources, and feedback loops so every builder compounds faster.</p><ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-white/70"><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-accent-cyan">&gt;</span><span>Adaptive missions sequenced by the Cognitive Activation Protocol™</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-accent-cyan">&gt;</span><span>Real-time agent collaboration for strategy, code, and governance</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-accent-cyan">&gt;</span><span>Proof signals that unlock deeper staking and DAO missions</span></li></ul></div><div class="glass-effect rounded-2xl p-6 text-left"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-accent-cyan mb-3">Proof Becomes Capital</h3><p class="text-base text-white/80 mb-4 leading-relaxed">Each completed phase mints verifiable Proof-of-Skill™ credentials that level up access to talent, liquidity, and networked capital.</p><ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-white/70"><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-accent-cyan">&gt;</span><span>Mint NFTs that certify milestones across Solana, DePIN, and DeFi tracks</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-accent-cyan">&gt;</span><span>Stake MFAI to access premium missions and sovereign capital pools</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-accent-cyan">&gt;</span><span>Participate in Synaptic Governance with on-chain voting power</span></li></ul></div></div><div style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between gap-4 mb-8"><div><h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Select Your Prototype Arena</h3><p class="text-base opacity-70">Preview every mission, reward, and agent support layer before diving into the full dashboard.</p></div><button class="btn-secondary" tabindex="0">View detailed roadmap →</button></div><div class="grid gap-6"><article class="neon-border card-surface-layer relative flex flex-col gap-6 overflow-hidden p-6 text-left transition-transform duration-500 ease-out-quart motion-safe:hover:shadow-neon-ring " tabindex="0" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px);"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 lg:flex-row"><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-5"><div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-start"><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><div class="relative flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-500 to-cyan-400 text-3xl shadow-neon-ring"><span aria-hidden="true">🧠</span></div><div><p class="mfai-chip">Genesis Cognition Pass</p><h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold leading-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-mfai-text md:text-2xl">The Cognitive Activation Hub</h3></div></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span class="mfai-chip"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-compass" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m16.24 7.76-1.804 5.411a2 2 0 0 1-1.265 1.265L7.76 16.24l1.804-5.411a2 2 0 0 1 1.265-1.265z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle></svg> 6 phases</span><span class="mfai-chip bg-info/15 text-info"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" strok